<urn:atm:triage:finding/AXPE-QA-117>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AXPE-QA-117" ;
  triage:title "docs/atm-error-codes.md registry missing the five AX.6 doctor codes" ;
  triage:description "docs/atm-error-codes.md declares itself the single source of truth for ATM-owned error codes and forbids codes outside it, and docs/requirements.md:97 relies on that ownership claim, yet the five AX.6 doctor warning codes ATM_ROSTER_NO_LEAD, ATM_ROSTER_MULTIPLE_LEADS, ATM_ROSTER_RESERVED_NAME, ATM_TASK_STALLED, ATM_MEMBER_BLOCKED (present in crates/atm-error/src/error_codes.rs, error_catalog.rs and requirements.md section 11.3) have zero occurrences in docs/atm-error-codes.md. The broader under-enumeration of the registry pre-dates AX and is out of scope. Remediation: add the five codes to the registry section of docs/atm-error-codes.md reusing the remediation text at docs/requirements.md:2207-2211 (or explicitly narrow the ownership claim in requirements.md section 1 if the doc is intentionally not kept current)." ;
